    {
      "ordinal": 0,
      "label": "sdc02_4kings_d_01_clerk_00",
      "hash64": "743806B7EE256EA4",
      "text": "你可以自由参观\\n四天王小队～！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 1,
      "label": "sdc02_4kings_d_01_clerk_01",
      "hash64": "743807B7EE257057",
      "text": "这里是极地广场，\\n四天王杜若的小队欢迎你来！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 2,
      "label": "sdc02_4kings_d_01_clerk_02",
      "hash64": "743808B7EE25720A",
      "text": "你是蓝莓联盟的挑战者\\n……[VAR 0x0100(0000)]，没错吧？",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 13,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0100",
          "args_hex": [
            "0000"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 3,
      "label": "sdc02_4kings_d_01_clerk_03",
      "hash64": "743809B7EE2573BD",
      "text": "参加四天王挑战\\n需要支付５０ＢＰ！\\r\\n你愿意支付吗？",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 17,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 4,
      "label": "sdc02_4kings_d_01_dragonbb_01",
      "hash64": "4196A3A64BDC857D",
      "text": "啊～等一下，等一下，\\n那家伙不用付！[VAR 0x0114(004A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 18,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "004A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 5,
      "label": "sdc02_4kings_d_01_clerk_04",
      "hash64": "743802B7EE2567D8",
      "text": "阿若！\\n但这是规则……",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 6,
      "label": "sdc02_4kings_d_01_dragonbb_02",
      "hash64": "4196A0A64BDC8064",
      "text": "那好～我来付吧～\\n……这样就没问题了吧～？[VAR 0x0114(004A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 21,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "004A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 7,
      "label": "sdc02_4kings_d_01_clerk_05",
      "hash64": "743803B7EE25698B",
      "text": "啊，这……\\n我知道了，本次免费。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
